{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“怕一心软就忘了为何离开”说成“害怕重新经历曾经受过的委屈”。两者有关，但原文重点是怕忘记离开的理由，而不是直接表达害怕重演。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“不服气渐渐淡了”理解成主动放下与过去的争辩。完整稿强调的是争得没了力气、抵抗逐渐耗尽，并非已经想通或与过去和解。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“想找回从前的亲近”说成“想回到过去”，混淆了渴望亲近感与实际回去。另外，“早知道这样，他还会走吗”表达的是反复动摇和追问，不等于已经确定后悔。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“不愿只凭希望回去忍让”扩大成“不再依靠过去的幻想”，漏掉了“仍想万一能”所保留的可能性。原文是暂缓回去的决定、先稳住眼下，而不是彻底放弃回去的希望。“释然”也偏强，原文只是心里稍松。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把能够决定怎样站立理解成已经重新坚定、坦然。原文仍明确承认自己会犹疑、疲惫、想念，脚步踏实也不代表内心已经完全安稳。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 3,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲主线基本一致，准确抓住了离开后的失落、怀念、孤独、自我怀疑，以及最终不再为留住别人而委屈自己的转变；但把第十一屏暂缓回去、保留“万一能”的态度略微说成了不再执着于回去，原稿实际上没有彻底消除这个可能性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "651dda6a-302f-4fe7-b133-cf96dc227392", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T165440683705Z", "elapsed_seconds": 177.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T16:57:37.701237+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9639ebca68398d96668cae34039a52c3bb1f45c204f815ec8fa49a351f72d434", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T165440683705Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "af925c3f94a77d643e55e2e2cde169edb907027037b8ed275e20125dec230c96"}}}
